{"id": "34411", "title": "澄庄", "author": "岑凯伦", "category": "文学名著", "count": 15, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/34/34411.htm", "intro": "香港少女来贝儿因生活贫困被迫脱下校服到某家会馆做吧女，被花花公子高卡达看中，千方百计地追求贝儿，然而始乱终弃。在生活的苦海之中，贝儿白天干活，晚上读书，靠自己的努力重新站起来。此时，偶遇富家公子卡迪，面对卡迪的真诚与热情，贝儿答应了卡迪的求婚。然而一踏进高家门，命运再次作弄了她，原来高卡达正是卡迪的哥哥。虽然卡迪对贝儿一往情深，无耐卡达从中作梗，使贝儿的人生道路一波三折……", "base": "files/article/html/34/34411", "chapters": [{"title": "第01节", "file": "2184820.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第02节", "file": "2184821.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第03节", "file": "2184822.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第04节", "file": "2184823.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第05节", "file": "2184824.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第06节", "file": "2184825.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第07节", "file": "2184826.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第08节", "file": "2184827.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第09节", "file": "2184828.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第10节", "file": "2184829.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第11节", "file": "2184830.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第12节", "file": "2184831.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第13节", "file": "2184832.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第14节", "file": "2184833.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第15节", "file": "2184834.html", "available": false}]}